   172	| Job / blocking check | Actor trust and input | Token / environment / secrets | Network | Outputs / retention | Approval |
   173	| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
   174	| `release/candidate-identity` | Trusted trigger; exact default-branch commit, signed/annotated tag metadata if present, declared version | `contents: read`; no production environment; no secrets | GitHub metadata read only | Immutable candidate manifest and tag/ref evidence; release-record/7y | None |
