   203	
   204	| Job / blocking check | Actor trust and input | Token / environment / secrets | Network | Outputs / retention | Approval |
   205	| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
   300	
   301	Artifacts are uploaded under attempt-unique, candidate-digest-addressed names.
   302	Every downstream download verifies the expected manifest digest and each file
   303	digest before use. GitHub artifact IDs or filenames alone are insufficient.
   304	Release jobs rebuild from the immutable candidate or consume only protected
   305	staging receipts; they never promote artifacts produced by untrusted PR code.
