   370	| `build/workspace-legacy` / `TASK-260715-3mk4hs` | target/scheme removal, generator/identifier drift, dirty generation, legacy regression |
   371	| `test/core-protocol` / `TASK-260715-1m3edc` | omitted suite/vector, malformed/oversized input regression, timeout, leak, retry-dependent flaky pass |
   372	| `build/apple-credential-free` / `TASK-260715-1uxx3i` | identity lookup, iOS scheme in macOS-only mode, identifier/embed/entitlement/link/version drift, signing claim from unsigned output |
   373	| `build/relay-four-target` / `TASK-260715-36gq4m` | missing/duplicate target, mutable fetch, target/identity/protocol/checksum mismatch, partial matrix |
